     <h2 style="margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">一、指导思想</span></strong></h2><p style="margin-right:4px;margin-left:8px;text-indent:29px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">为贯彻落实《教育部、中央军委国防动员部关于印发</span><span style="font-family:宋体"><高中阶段学校学生军事训练教学大纲>》的精神，为了增强高一新生的国防意识，磨练学生的意志，让学生接触军营，了解军人，体验部队训练和生活，培养学生爱国主义、集体主义精神，激发学生积极向上、奋发进取的热情，从而使学生具有严明的组织纪律性，养成良好的学习、生活、卫生习惯。学校决定对高一新生进行为期七天的军训，特制定本方案。</span></span></p><h2 style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">二、组织机构</span></strong></h2><h3 style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-weight: normal;font-size: 20px">1.军训工作领导小组</span></h3><p style="margin-right:4px;text-indent:42px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">组</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">长：丁初效</span></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 0;text-indent: 42px;padding: 0;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">副组长：蒋明、施建昌、杨佩琼、朱水军、冯王亮、任联君、裘东、祝智浩、刘明玉</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 0;text-indent: 42px;padding: 0;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">成</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">员：马丹娜、王月琴、孟德超、何隽豪、余栋材、王佩金、王青、孙祯澍；高一各班班主任；</span><span style="font-family:宋体">医务（范国娟、魏杲）；</span></span></p><h3 style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-weight: normal;font-size: 20px">2.工作小组及职责</span></h3><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1）训练工作组 </span></span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">成员：德育处、全体教官</span></span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">职责：落实训练计划，组织队列训练、内务整理、国防教育、纪律教育；把控训练强度与进度，规范训练流程，确保训练安全有序。</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2）管理工作组 </span></span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">成员：德育处、教学处、年管会、全体班主任</span></span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">职责：全程管理，负责学生素养提升、考勤、思想引导、心理疏导、纪律监督等；协同教官做好内务、队列、考勤与家校沟通；及时上报学生异常情况。</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">3）安全保障组 </span></span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">成员：安全处、校医室人员、安保后勤人员</span></span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">职责：负责校园安全、交通疏导、场地排查；做好医疗保障、应急救护、中暑处置、伤病登记；落实安全巡查与隐患整改。</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">4）后勤保障组 </span></span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">成员：总务处、住管处、后勤工作人员</span></span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">职责：保障训练场地、饮水、遮阳、多媒体、照明等物资；落实食堂卫生、用餐秩序、住宿管理；做好物资供应与环境保障。</span></p><h2 style="margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">三、军训安排：</span></strong></h2><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">1.训练时间：2026年 8 月 23日——2026年 8 月 29日</span></p><h3 style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-weight: normal;font-size: 20px">2.训练地点：学校田径场、篮球场、网球场、体育馆、图书馆报告厅（讲座）、学生宿舍（内务训练）、班级教室（素养提升）等。</span></h3><h3 style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-weight: normal;font-size: 20px">3.军训内容</span></h3><p style="margin-right:4px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1）基本军事知识学习：人民军队、现代国防、军兵种知识</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:4px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2）基本军事技能训练：单兵队列动作、队列队形训练、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">战术训练、格斗基础和军事体育</span></p><p style="margin-right:4px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">3）急救技能培训、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">卫生与救护、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">消防</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">安全</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">培训、紧急逃生演练</span></p><p style="margin-right:4px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">4）军旅文化学习：内务整理、仪容仪表</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:4px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">5）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">国防教育：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">国防科技普及</span></p><p style="margin-right:4px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">6</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">）合唱表演：合唱比赛</span></p><h2 style="margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">四、军训步骤</span></strong></h2><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">本次军训分三个阶段实施：</span></p><h3 style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-weight: normal;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（一）动员准备阶段（军训前</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1 天 / 首日上午）</span></span></h3><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">1.召开军训会议，宣布方案、明确纪律、提出要求；</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">2.教官与班主任对接，分班编组，明确训练区域；</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">3.开展安全教育、仪容仪表检查、物资准备；</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">4.讲解军训意义、规章制度、安全须知。</span></p><h3 style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-weight: normal;font-size: 20px">（二）集中训练阶段（全程核心阶段）</span></h3><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">1.按军训要求和计划组织实施每日训练；</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">2.采取教官示范、分班训练、合练评比、纠错强化相结合；</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">3.穿插国防讲座、消防演练、合唱比赛等活动；</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">4.每日落实考勤、体能观察、安全提醒。</span></p><h3 style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-weight: normal;font-size: 20px">（三）总结汇报阶段（最后半天）</span></h3><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">1.组织军训队列展示；</span></p><p style="vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">2.评选表彰；本次军训各项先进设奖包括：</span></p><p style="text-indent: 21px;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">军训积极分子：每连</span><span style="font-family:宋体">10 人（不含校荐标兵）；</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 21px;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">校军训标兵：每连</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1 人；</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 21px;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">会操比赛：一等奖</span><span style="font-family:宋体">12 个、二等奖 11个；</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 21px;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">寝室内务优胜奖：男、女寝室各</span><span style="font-family:宋体">10 个；</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 21px;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">合唱比赛：一等奖</span><span style="font-family:宋体">7 个、二等奖 8 个、三等奖 8 个；</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 21px;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">军训先进连队</span><span style="font-family:宋体">10 个；</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 21px;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">军训最佳连队</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1 个。</span></span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">3.总结讲评，巩固军训成果。</span></p><h2 style="margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">五、相关要求</span></strong></h2><h3 style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-weight: normal;font-size: 20px">（一）纪律要求</span></h3><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">1.一切行动听指挥，严格遵守军训作息，不迟到、不早退、不无故缺席；</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">2.尊重教官、尊敬老师、团结同学，禁止打闹、顶撞、脱离队伍单独行动；</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">3.仪容仪表统一，按要求着装，不佩戴饰品，不玩手机，不做与军训无关事项；</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">4.严格执行请假制度，因病、因特殊情况需请假，须履行书面审批手续。</span></p><h3 style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-weight: normal;font-size: 20px">（二）安全要求</span></h3><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">1.坚持安全第一、科学施训，根据天气、学生身体状况合理调整强度；</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">2.有心脏病、哮喘、癫痫、严重过敏、近期手术等特殊体质学生，须提前报备，可安排随队见习或适度参与；</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">3.学生如出现头晕、恶心、中暑、扭伤等身体不适情况，要立即报告教官与班主任，及时就医处置；</span></p><h3 style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-weight: normal;font-size: 20px">（三）管理要求</span></h3><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">1.班主任全程在岗，做好管理、服务、沟通；</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">2.教官文明施训、科学施训、严慈相济；</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">3.后勤、安保、医疗全程保障，确保饮水、防暑、应急物资到位；</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">4.各部门协同配合，形成工作闭环，确保军训规范、有序、高效。</span></p><h3 style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-weight: normal;font-size: 20px">（四）成果巩固</span></h3><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">军训结束后，将军训成果转化为日常行为规范，持续强化纪律意识、内务标准、集体观念，推动班风校风建设常态化。</span></p><h2 style="margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0;vertical-align: baseline;line-height: 24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 20px">附：军训具体安排表</span></strong></h2><p style="margin-top:5px;margin-left:34px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><table width="685" style="width: 551px;"><tbody><tr style="height:24px" class="firstRow"><td width="38" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;"><p style=";text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12px">日期</span></strong></p></td><td width="125" valign="center" colspan="2" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12px">时间</span></strong></p></td><td width="214" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="vertical-align: middle"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12px">活动安排</span></strong></p></td><td width="110" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="vertical-align: middle"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12px">场地</span></strong></p></td><td width="198" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="vertical-align: middle"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12px">负责人</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="height:24px"><td width="38" valign="center" rowspan=